{"version":1,"content":"<p>【AI 時代 ⚠️】人類，準備好接受現實了嗎？</p><p>OpenAI 公布最新研究成果，其硬體研發團隊藉由旗艦 AI 模型 GPT-6 Astra 全自動工作，在不到一週的時間內，自主完成一款名為「Codex Pet」的實物語音硬體裝置。</p><p>由工業外觀、內部機械結構、電路板佈線以至底層韌體編寫全由 AI 包辦，標誌著 AI 模型已具備協同甚至主導端到端（End-to-End）實體產品研發的潛力。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:45:45.401063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T19:18:20.467483+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:38:32.280894+00:00","content_hash":"5f13363f8a7d56bf13ad0c61e6e504841710cd5fadf8701c5eb9d6191edac7dd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}